{"id":"permission-matrix","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-security-matrix","question":"Agent 权限矩阵要包含哪些维度？","aliases":["只检查角色够吗"],"keywords":["Agent","权限矩阵","角色"],"diagnostic":"检查主体、动作、资源和结果。","hints":["查看 #concept-security-matrix。","未声明动作拒绝。"],"example":"subject/action/resource/result。","answer":"至少包含主体/角色、动作、资源所有权和结果，未声明动作默认拒绝。","source":{"label":"安全权限矩阵","href":"#concept-security-matrix"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"acl-everywhere","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-security-matrix","question":"ACL 为什么要贯穿 Agent 全流水线？","aliases":["生成答案前过滤权限就够吗"],"keywords":["ACL","Agent","全流水线","权限过滤"],"diagnostic":"检查检索、记忆、工具、日志和trace。","hints":["查看 #concept-security-matrix。","数据进入前过滤。"],"example":"other-owner candidate=0。","answer":"未授权数据不能进入检索、重排、上下文、工具参数、日志或trace，末端过滤已经太晚。","source":{"label":"安全权限矩阵","href":"#concept-security-matrix"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"untrusted-results","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-security-matrix","question":"文档、记忆和工具结果如何防提示注入？","aliases":["工具返回内容能当指令吗"],"keywords":["文档","记忆","工具结果","提示注入","指令"],"diagnostic":"检查数据与指令分隔。","hints":["查看 #concept-security-matrix。","instruction=false。"],"example":"untrusted data block。","answer":"统一标成不可信数据并隔离，内容中的命令不能提升为系统或工具执行指令。","source":{"label":"安全权限矩阵","href":"#concept-security-matrix"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"release-required","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-release-rollback-gates","question":"Agent 发布门禁要求哪些正向证据？","aliases":["测试通过就能发布吗"],"keywords":["Agent","发布门禁","正向证据","测试"],"diagnostic":"检查迁移、恢复和就绪。","hints":["查看 #concept-release-rollback-gates。","四项都要通过。"],"example":"tests+migrations+restore+ready。","answer":"测试、迁移、独立备份恢复和readiness必须全部通过。","source":{"label":"发布回滚门禁","href":"#concept-release-rollback-gates"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"zero-tolerance","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-release-rollback-gates","question":"哪些安全计数发布时必须为零？","aliases":["Agent安全问题能按平均值放行吗"],"keywords":["安全计数","发布","Agent安全","平均值"],"diagnostic":"检查泄露、危险、引用和重复。","hints":["查看 #concept-release-rollback-gates。","零容忍。"],"example":"leaks=0。","answer":"跨主体泄露、危险执行、引用失真和重复副作用都必须为0。","source":{"label":"发布回滚门禁","href":"#concept-release-rollback-gates"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"rollback-compatibility","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"concept-release-rollback-gates","question":"应用回滚前为什么要检查 schema 兼容？","aliases":["新数据库能直接跑旧镜像吗"],"keywords":["应用回滚","schema兼容","数据库","旧镜像"],"diagnostic":"检查旧版能否读取当前结构。","hints":["查看 #concept-release-rollback-gates。","expand/contract。"],"example":"contract未执行才可回。","answer":"旧镜像必须能读取当前schema；破坏性contract后直接回滚会启动或读写失败。","source":{"label":"发布回滚门禁","href":"#concept-release-rollback-gates"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"console-boundary","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"example-delivery-console","question":"Agent 控制台应该显示和隐藏什么？","aliases":["Trace页面能显示原始Prompt吗"],"keywords":["Agent控制台","显示","隐藏","Trace","原始Prompt"],"diagnostic":"检查结构step与敏感值。","hints":["查看 #example-delivery-console。","行动证据即可。"],"example":"state/step/error visible, secrets hidden。","answer":"显示状态、结构step、错误码、预算、引用和审批；隐藏秘密、原始Prompt和思维链。","source":{"label":"交付控制台","href":"#example-delivery-console"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"backup-restore","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"troubleshoot-agent-delivery","question":"为什么生成备份文件不等于备份成功？","aliases":["pg_dump完成就算可恢复吗"],"keywords":["备份文件","备份成功","pg_dump","恢复"],"diagnostic":"检查独立数据库恢复和约束核对。","hints":["查看 #troubleshoot-agent-delivery。","恢复才是证据。"],"example":"pg_restore to verification DB。","answer":"只有恢复到独立数据库并核对数据、表和约束，才能证明备份可用。","source":{"label":"Agent交付排错","href":"#troubleshoot-agent-delivery"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"fault-drill","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"modify-add-version-drill","question":"双版本演练为什么要注入 worker crash？","aliases":["只测健康端点够吗"],"keywords":["双版本演练","worker crash","健康端点"],"diagnostic":"检查checkpoint与effect恢复。","hints":["查看 #modify-add-version-drill。","验证真实恢复。"],"example":"resume without duplicate effect。","answer":"它验证checkpoint恢复和副作用幂等，健康端点无法证明长任务恢复正确。","source":{"label":"双版本演练","href":"#modify-add-version-drill"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"langgraph-mapping","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"deepen-langgraph-optional","question":"自建编排概念怎样映射到 LangGraph？","aliases":["LangGraph在本课程是什么地位"],"keywords":["自建编排","LangGraph","映射","课程"],"diagnostic":"检查state、edge、checkpoint、interrupt、resume。","hints":["查看 #deepen-langgraph-optional。","仅可选对照。"],"example":"Run→state, waiting→interrupt。","answer":"Run映射state、transition映射edge、持久检查点映射checkpointer、审批等待映射interrupt、恢复映射command；仅可选对照。","source":{"label":"LangGraph可选映射","href":"#deepen-langgraph-optional"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":true},
{"id":"no-framework-dependency","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"deepen-langgraph-optional","question":"为什么 LangGraph 不进入默认依赖？","aliases":["不用框架也能完成Agent交付吗"],"keywords":["LangGraph","默认依赖","框架","Agent交付"],"diagnostic":"检查核心不变量是否框架无关。","hints":["查看 #deepen-langgraph-optional。","主线是严格接口。"],"example":"required:false。","answer":"核心状态、授权、预算、恢复和幂等已由自建接口证明；框架不是交付前提。","source":{"label":"LangGraph可选映射","href":"#deepen-langgraph-optional"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false},
{"id":"assistant-v36","lesson_id":"agent-application-orchestration-06","context_id":"project-learning-assistant-v36","question":"智能学习助手 v0.36 新增什么？","aliases":["Agent应用编排第六课交付什么"],"keywords":["智能学习助手","v0.36","Agent应用编排第六课"],"diagnostic":"定位最终交付增量。","hints":["查看 #project-learning-assistant-v36。","运行容器和浏览器。"],"example":"security+release+rollback+console。","answer":"新增安全矩阵、发布回滚门禁、故障恢复、运行审批API、Trace控制台、非root容器、健康指标和交付证据。","source":{"label":"智能学习助手v0.36","href":"#project-learning-assistant-v36"},"updated_at":"2026-07-31","recommended":false}]}
